    <text>
        <body>
            <div xml:id="d686">

                <pb facs="0925" n="815" xml:id="pg815"/>

                <note rend="inline" type="source">871.51 Rumanian Loan/5: Telegram</note>
                <head><hi rendition="#italic">The Secretary of State to
                        the Minister in Rumania</hi> (<hi rendition="#italic"
                            >Culbertson</hi>)</head>
                <opener><seg rendition="#center">[Paraphrase]</seg></opener>
                <opener><dateline rendition="#float-right"><placeName><hi rendition="#small-caps"
                                >Washington</hi></placeName>, <date calendar="gregorian"
                            when="1928-01-28T14:00:00-05:00"><hi rendition="#italic">January 28,
                                1928—2 p.m.</hi></date></dateline></opener>
                <p>5. Reference your 8, January 26, noon. The Department is attempting to verify the
                    statement made by Monnet and Denis.</p>
                <p>Meanwhile, in connection with negotiating a loan no matter what conditions
                    American financiers may stipulate regarding settling pending questions between
                    the United States and Rumania, you are to avoid scrupulously giving an
                    impression that the United States Government associates in any way with the
                    question of an American loan the negotiations for a treaty, the settlement of
                    claims, or the revising of the Rumanian mining law.</p>
                <closer><signed><hi rendition="#small-caps">Kellogg</hi></signed></closer>
            </div>
        </body>
